    "en": "Floor heaters: pair digital sensor probes by typing the probe ID, and pair sensor channels as read-only temperature devices. Added UV send modes and universal switch signal logging. Fixed dimmers flashing to 100% before the requested dim level, universal switch errors on status-less signals, and unparsable curtain duration responses. Updated to smart-bus 0.10.0 and relicensed the app to MIT."
